Hello All,

4" and 6" Sewer 11 =BCO Bends both GxG and GxS will be of the "formed" desi=
gn meaning made from a single piece of pipe that has been bent.  This means=
 there are no glue joints or fusion joints internal to the fitting.

This will make for a more compact fitting with less workmanship risk in man=
ufacture.

The formed elbow design will be implemented in most product lines where it =
is useful.


John

--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA23MAIL_
